| !Run for !YSFlight (test build: the game in a desktop window).
| Lines starting with | are comments.
Set YSFlight$Dir <Obey$Dir>

| The program is an Absolute file with UnixLib inside it, but it needs
| UnixLib's SharedUnixLibrary and ARMEABISupport (both from PackMan).
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 IfThere System:Modules.SharedULib Then RMLoad System:Modules.SharedULib
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 Error YSFlight needs SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 or later. Install it with PackMan.
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 IfThere System:Modules.ARMEABISupport Then RMLoad System:Modules.ARMEABISupport
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 Error YSFlight needs the ARMEABISupport module. Install it with PackMan.
| UnixLib's thread timer module, for the simulator's threads. It must be
| loaded before the program starts.
RMEnsure PThreadTicker 0.01 IfThere System:Modules.PThrTicker Then RMLoad System:Modules.PThrTicker
RMEnsure PThreadTicker 0.01 RMLoad <YSFlight$Dir>.PThrTicker
| A hardware overlay can show the picture (*Set EGL$Overlay on): load
| ROOL's VideoOverlay module if it's there. YSFlight runs without it.
RMEnsure VideoOverlay 0.00 IfThere System:Modules.VideoOverlay Then RMLoad System:Modules.VideoOverlay

| Messages go to this file (printing from a desktop program would open
| a command window). The |< keeps <Wimp$ScrapDir> for UnixLib to expand.
Set YSFlight$Log /|<Wimp$ScrapDir>/YSFlightLog

| Window size, and the size the picture is drawn at (then stretched to
| the window). Drawing fewer pixels is much faster with software
| OpenGL. Take the | off a line to use it.
Unset YSFlight$Size
Unset YSFlight$Render
| Set YSFlight$Size 960x720
| Set YSFlight$Render 640x480

| The simulator hands work to 4 threads, which on RISC OS all share one
| processor core. To compare speed with the work done in order instead,
| take the | off the Set line. The log (YSFlightLog) gets a timing line
| every 5 seconds.
Unset YSFlight$Threads
| Set YSFlight$Threads 0

| The program (about 16 MB) is loaded into the slot; its heap goes in
| dynamic areas ("YSFlight Heap").
WimpSlot -min 20480K -max 20480K
Run <YSFlight$Dir>.!RunImage %*0
